%description -n texlive-pgf-pie
The package provides the means to draw pie (and variant) charts, using
PGF/TikZ.

%package -n texlive-pgf-soroban
Summary:        Create images of the soroban using TikZ/PGF
Version:        svn32269
License:        LPPL-1.3c
